'''Type of Feat''': [[Class]]

'''Prerequisite''': [[Anti-paladin]] 3

'''Specifics''': An Anti-paladin may use as a [[spell-like ability]]. If the target has less than 10 [[hit point|HP]] and fails a [[will]] save vs. [[DC]] of 12 + [[Wis]] [[modifier]], the target dies and the caster gains +2 [[Str]], +1d8 HP, and a +1 [[caster level]] for a number of [[turn]]s equal to the caster level.

'''Use''': Selected.

